### Test 1: Nested Array Failure (Should be 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Test",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": 5000,
  "lines": [ { "dishId": "abc", "quantity": 2 } ]
}



### Test 2: TeleBirr Validation (Should be 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Test",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": 5000,
  "lines": [{"dishId": 1, "quantity": 1}],
  "phone": "0812345678"
}



### Test 3: Santim Validation (Should be 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Test",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": 240.5,
  "lines": [{"dishId": 1, "quantity": 1}]
}



### Test 4: Extra fields rejected (Should be 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Test",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": 5000,
  "lines": [{"dishId": 1, "quantity": 1}],
  "isAdmin": true
}


### Test 5: Invalid Status Transition (Should be 409)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/4/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PENDING"
}


{
  "statusCode": 400,
  "message": ["..."],
  "path": "/api/v1/orders",
  "timestamp": "2026-11-18T...",
  "requestId": "unknown"
}